# dnd_mud project

**Stack:** Python **3.12**, console MUD, Colorama, file-based storage, pytest.

**Принцип:** [`dnd-mud-python.mdc`](dnd-mud-python.mdc), [`dnd-mud-tests.mdc`](dnd-mud-tests.mdc).

## Commands

`.venv` обязателен — [`venv.mdc`](~/.cursor/rules/venv.mdc).

```bash
make install          # venv + pip install -e ".[dev]"
make verify-changed   # подзадача (pre-commit)
# verify-scope — только в dnd-mud-review (конец task-ветки)
# make verify       — CI / release
make test / make check  # по запросу или CI
python main.py        # smoke меню (в review при UI-diff)
```

Verify/review policy — [`dnd-mud-workflow.mdc`](dnd-mud-workflow.mdc) §Verify / review; skills — [`.cursor/skills/`](.cursor/skills/README.md).

